-- 7. Tatcha: The Geisha's Playbook
VALUES ('Tatcha: The Geisha''s Playbook', 'Ancient Wisdom, Modern Glow', 'This is the story of a woman who spent her life following the "rules" of success—Wall Street, high-level corporate titles, and tireless hustle—only to have her body physically reject her life. A story of bleeding skin, a 200-year-old silk-bound book, and the moment a geisha in Kyoto taught a Harvard MBA that "luxury" isn''t what you have, but how you care for yourself.', '🌸', 'story', 'ladyboss-stories', '#E8D5FF', 'square', true, false, 36, 12, NULL);

